    "reason": "The original taxonomy searched an unfiltered DOCX paragraph list and did not exclude InTableOfContents paragraphs. A TOC listing line repeats a heading's title with a trailing page number and can carry the same NumberingId styling as the real heading paragraph, so 21/23 DOCX_AUTO_NUMBERED_TITLE_ONLY conflated real body anchors with TOC-only matches. Production alignment (and R2) always excluded InTableOfContents paragraphs; the taxonomy that first diagnosed 057 did not."
  },
