  "correctedReading": "057's root cause is not one mechanism (auto-numbering vs PDF-baked marker) as first diagnosed. Three separate, compounding factors: (1) SourceFactsBuilder's marker-grammar depth on real PDF marker shapes, (2) span-lane HeadingSpan boundary imprecision, (3) the ORIGINAL EVIDENCE's own TOC contamination - not a fourth production mechanism, since production alignment already filters InTableOfContents correctly. Of the 13 targets with a real body anchor, only 11 carry NumberingId (the remaining 2 have a real paragraph but no numbering to align against). The other 9 targets have no body anchor in the production paragraph population at all - their only match is a TOC line - so no in-scope remediation could recover them; whether they have a valid body anchor by some other means is a separate, unscoped question this correction does not answer.",
